cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Vajra in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Vajra — Local-First AI Agent Workspace"
abstract: >-
  Vajra is an offline-first AI agent workspace written in Go. It provides a
  terminal UI, a web GUI and a REST API on top of local model servers such as
  Ollama, with swarm orchestration (parallel specialist agents that message
  each other) and a four-layer verification pipeline. No telemetry, no cloud
  dependency.
